title: "Four top-level commands implement one concept: dedupe-audit, dedupe-merge, duplicates and comments-audit are separate nouns for finding and reconciling duplicate content"
description: "Consolidate dedupe-audit, dedupe-merge, duplicates, and comments-audit into one duplicate-governance noun with explicit discovery and reconciliation verbs. Preserve all legacy spellings as hidden aliases and prove the consolidated contract retains every detection, annotation, and merge capability."
